---
description: Expected failures are AppError subclasses with a stable code and no HTTP status. One error mapper turns a code into a status and the { error } envelope.
globs: ["**/src/core/errors/**/*.ts", "**/src/api/http/error-mapper.ts", "**/src/domains/**/*.ts", "**/src/api/http/**/*.controller.ts"]
alwaysApply: false
